tica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">宇树科技将于6月1日科创板IPO上会，冲击人形机器人与具身智能第一股</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">华为AI眼镜正式全渠道开售，定价2499元搭载自研芯片与小艺智能体</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI向日本核心金融机构开放GPT-5.5 Cyber模型以应对AI网络攻击</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英伟达发布RTX Spark处理器，计划于2026年挑战苹果M系列芯片</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/857deb2f90e5f536240b29492851cd99.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">英伟达在Computex 2024期间正式发布代号为“RTX Spark”的Arm架构高性能笔记本处理器，计划于2026年量产上市。该芯片定位为“超级芯片”，旨在高端移动计算领域正面挑战苹果M系列芯片的统治地位，标志着英伟达加速重返客户端CPU市场。技术层面，RTX Spark结合了英伟达在GPU与本地AI算力方面的优势，并深度适配Windows 11系统的Copilot+ AI功能，旨在实现高能效比下的端侧大模型部署与生成式AI任务处理。英伟达此举不仅是产品线的战略延伸，更是对AI PC赛道的重大布局。行业分析认为，RTX Spark的入局将显著改写移动计算竞争格局，推动Windows on Arm生态成熟，并有望成为打破x86架构与macOS生态平衡的关键力量，对移动PC底层架构演进及端侧AI应用普及具有深</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">比亚迪发布首颗车规级4nm智驾芯片璇玑A3，算力对齐英伟达Thor</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/c9ab42302eef436f7387cb11e089f78f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">比亚迪于5月29日正式发布首颗全链路自主研发的4nm车规级智驾芯片“璇玑A3”，标志着国产车载AI计算芯片进入全球第一梯队。该芯片采用16核CPU，算力达420K DMIPS，内存带宽为273GB/s，三颗芯片组合理论峰值算力超2100TOPS。璇玑A3摒弃通用GPU架构，采用专用NPU路线，将AI算子硬件化，使单位算力功耗降低20%，算法资源利用率翻倍。比亚迪承诺，搭载该芯片的车辆在城市领航期间若发生辅助驾驶事故，平台将全额赔付经济损失且不设上限。目前比亚迪拥有7000人芯片研发团队及5座晶圆厂，璇玑A3的发布不仅为L3与L4级自动驾驶提供硬件支撑，也为具身智能时代构建了通用物理AI平台底座，进一步强化了比亚迪在智驾全链路自研闭环的竞争优势。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">宇树科技将于6月1日科创板IPO上会，冲击人形机器人与具身智能第一股</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b97ef577a3d3e3e74954819deac5e137.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">杭州宇树科技股份有限公司将于6月1日正式迎来科创板IPO首发审议，成为本周3家上会企业之一，全力冲刺人形机器人与具身智能第一股。宇树科技专注于高性能通用人形机器人、四足机器人、机器人组件及具身智能模型的研发、生产与销售，在全球范围内率先实现了高性能四足机器人的公开销售与行业落地，其相关产品销量持续保持全球领先地位。当前具身智能正处于从实验室走向规模化量产的关键过渡期，宇树科技此次冲击资本市场，标志着AI与物理世界深度融合的硬件载体加速驶入快车道。随着大模型技术持续赋能机器人交互与控制，宇树科技若成功上市，将有望进一步重塑全球机器人产业链供给格局，并为具身智能产业的规模化落地提供充裕的资金与生态支持，推动行业商业化进程显著提速。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">华为AI眼镜正式全渠道开售，定价2499元搭载自研芯片与小艺智能体</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/970da96433155471c3ba0dacdfe53357.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">6月1日，华为AI眼镜正式全渠道开售，官方定价2499元，新增钛银灰配色。该设备通过轻量化材料与精密堆叠技术，将镜腿厚度压缩至6.25毫米，整机重量仅35.5克，获SGS“低疲劳舒适佩戴”五星认证。核心性能上，该眼镜搭载自研AI芯片，支持端侧大模型运行，并集成1200万像素超感光摄像头。用户可通过语音或快捷键唤醒“小艺智能体”，实现“小艺看世界”实时景观识别、AI拍照卡路里分析及“看一下支付”等高阶交互功能。此外，该产品是业内首款支持HDR Vivid标准的AI眼镜，综合续航达12小时，支持连续8小时语音通话或9小时音乐播放。华为此次通过软硬件深度融合，旨在推动端侧AI在常态化生活场景的普及，为智能穿戴设备迈向“具身智能”提供新范式。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI向日本核心金融机构开放GPT-5.5 Cyber模型以应对AI网络攻击</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/8bab4103eedbea4b33ba872db755b5ef.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI已正式向日本核心金融机构开放GPT-5.5 Cyber模型的使用权限，旨在应对由高阶AI驱动的新型网络攻击威胁。此次合作由日美政府协商推动，三菱日联银行、三井住友银行及瑞穗银行等日本三大金融巨头预计将首批接入该模型。GPT-5.5 Cyber作为防御型AI模型，将用于提升日本金融体系的抗风险能力与网络攻防水平。日本财务省表示，此举是强化国家金融安全的关键部署。此外，日本政府计划后续引入Anthropic旗下的Claude Mythos模型，通过多模型协同作战，构建政企联合的网络安全防线，以应对日益严峻的黑客漏洞排查与恶意攻击挑战。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
